WEBVTT

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:14.200
So you want my powers to protect what's thine?

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:58.580
O Master... Please protect us.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:01.870
Please protect our souls.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.830
O Master... Please protect us.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:09.200
Please protect our souls.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.200
Silence!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.750
The shrine maiden will
tell us the words of our master.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.830
Disaster has passed, my children.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.500
Calm thine hearts and offer me thine prayers.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.870
When the heretic, the Sorcerer, appears again,

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.950
I shall exterminate them.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:38.000
O Master...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.410
O Master...

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:41.410
Let us pray to our master who had protected us

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:45.790
from the heretical Sorcerer
and retreated back into the forest.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.370
Prosperity to the heart of this forest!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.660
Prosperity to the heart of this forest!

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:59.790
Prosperity to the heart of this forest!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.450
Prosperity, eh?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.330
"Forest Maiden"

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.620
Who's there?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.870
I'm sorry. I had them attack you.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:16.330
Attack... me?

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:27.040
But I didn't think the Dragon
would try to maim you.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:33.000
I shall use my powers
to heal you as much as I can.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.000
Also, please do not defy MacDougal.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.750
It's because MacDougal
is here that this village is...

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.370
Where... am I?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.790
Who... am I?

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.910
Where does it hurt?

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.540
Where am I breathing from?

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.870
It appears as though you're awake, Sorcerer.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.330
Where am I?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.790
Unlike you fakes,

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:14.370
this is the place where we worship
the Dragon who has true power and Sorcery.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.620
Tell me your name.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:20.950
So you're going to stay silent.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.950
I'm sure he'd rather not answer.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.200
What do you mean by that, Salua?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.250
That man is wearing
the emblem of the Tower of Fangs.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.040
He's an elite in the world of Black Sorcery.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.750
And yet, he pathetically got captured,
so he'd probably rather not give his name.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.370
It doesn't matter if he's an elite or not.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.660
He's no match for this.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.700
I wouldn't jump the gun if I were you.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:52.000
Did you forget who's in charge here?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.120
You're definitely in charge
of this village, MacDougal.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.870
MacDougal?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.540
Please do not defy MacDougal.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.660
It'd be easy to execute
you right here, right now.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:18.160
But I need to ask you personally why a Sorcerer
from the Tower of Fangs came to our village.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:22.450
I'll question him thoroughly
tomorrow before we leave.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.250
Have you ever had any teeth
extracted without any anesthesia?

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:40.000
Prosperity to the pathetic little Sorcerer.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.660
Are you bringing that kid food?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.000
Yes.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.580
Your speech earlier...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:56.370
Your voice started to tremble at
the part about exterminating the Sorcerer.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.910
Huh?

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:03.200
Pretty sure the voice of a shrine maiden
who's supposed to tell the people

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.250
the word of god isn't supposed to get shaky.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.370
I-I...

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.330
Good night, Shrine Maiden.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.660
Well? Are you still in pain?

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.330
No, I'm fine.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.700
I brought you some food.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.160
I'm not hungry yet.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:40.660
But you know... As soon as I was shot
with the gun, I thought I was a goner.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.830
Well, I healed you right away.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.910
Did you use Sorcery?

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:02.290
It's the power of the forest.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.290
The power of the forest sure is something.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.580
Fiena, where's your family?

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.870
Family?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.580
Er, I, uh...

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.410
Sorry. You seem to be living
in this room all by yourself, so...

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.370
I can't reveal myself to others often.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.830
I might mess up if I do.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.200
Mess up?

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:34.540
I'm just a tool, used to keep
the people of this village in line.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.950
I only appear during special rituals,

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.580
say what I'm supposed to say,

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:43.580
and then... cause a miracle for the village.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.330
Just like you healed my wounds?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.000
That wasn't for the village's sake.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.790
I just wanted to save you.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:57.160
I mean, I'm grateful that
you healed my wounds, but...

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.580
Couldn't you do something about this?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.160
I'm glad you find this so amusing.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.700
I'm sorry.

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.620
It's not a big deal.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.910
Fiena, I told you.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.250
We're leaving soon.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.000
Yes, sir.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.000
Then why haven't you gotten ready?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.870
I...

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:25.500
Who's the one who took you in when
you were lost and all alone in the forest?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.290
I wasn't... lost.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.620
Then what were you doing?

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:49.370
I was searching... for you.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.620
You were searching for me?

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:58.620
So our encounter was fate.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:03.660
Because you showed up, I was able
to put this great plan into action.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.620
The forest must've given you to me.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:11.120
You, who uses Dragon Sorcery.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:18.290
You're going to use your powers
to find the heart of this forest.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.410
I...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.160
I didn't ask for your opinion.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.250
Hey, come on!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.830
Silence, you filthy Sorcerer.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.450
Majic, don't.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.660
I won't get shot again.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:33.330
I told you to shut your mouth.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.580
No, I'm going to say this.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.330
Fiena doesn't belong to you!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.580
Stop, MacDougal!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:53.330
My finger...

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.000
You must be doing this, Fiena...

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.790
Let me be the only victim.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:02.040
Fiena, do not disappoint me.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.120
You are the hope of this village.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:17.910
We're leaving tomorrow morning.

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.540
Sorry about that, Majic.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.910
It's okay.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:24.000
More importantly, where are my clothes?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:29.250
Oh, right. Your wounds have healed,
so you should probably leave in the morning.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.370
We'll leave together.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:31.700
Huh?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.830
You're going to leave, too.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.870
I... I can't.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.370
Why though? If you go with them,

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.870
you're going to be dragged
into something bad, aren't you?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.080
I'm fine. But you're...

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.950
I can't just leave you alone!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.620
Majic...

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.790
I can't leave you behind when you look so sad.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:58.200
You're better off when you're
smiling like you were earlier.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.910
You should be smiling.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.580
You're a very kind person.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.450
No, I just...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:13.580
Thank you. But I cannot leave this forest.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.910
You don't have to worry about MacDougal.

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:17.950
As soon as we join up with my master...

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.660
Your master?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.620
We're also traveling with this girl named
Claiomh who's a bit crude, but...

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.660
Oh, she's a good kid deep down inside.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.950
Um... I forgot to mention this but...

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.370
What were you thinking?!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:36.910
Stop screaming... My head's going to shatter.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:40.870
Here I am, relying on you,
and you get caught and can't even move?!

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.750
How pathetic can you be?!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.750
I was mentally attacked here.

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.160
You should praise me for even being alive.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.200
Mentally attacked?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.000
It's the Deep Dragon's Sorcery.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:57.750
Just one look and I was gone.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:01.700
If I hadn't gotten mental
control training at the Tower...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.250
If I'm lucky, I would've been maimed.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.790
Otherwise, I would've been
physically and mentally destroyed.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.410
Still, I'd lost all my memories up until now.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.290
This is all your fault!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.410
What are you talking about?

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.910
You were only caught because
you weren't skilled enough, Master.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.830
Meanwhile, I did something
heroic like try to save Fiena here,

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.500
so she was nursing me back to health.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:30.540
Master, anyone can see the difference between
being caught and being nursed back to health.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:37.040
Which is exactly why now we need
to take Fiena and get the heck out of here.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:40.200
Stop trying to act tough
just because there's a girl here.

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.660
What are you talking about?

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.790
That's not what's going on here!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:48.450
I just genuinely... Uh...

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.750
I guess you are about that age, little boy.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.910
That's really not it!

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.500
Fiena, was it?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.410
Y-Yes.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.500
Thank you for healing me.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.620
Huh?

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.330
I-It was nothing.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:08.080
You healed my master?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.200
No ordinary human could've healed me

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:15.830
after I'd almost been mentally destroyed
by an attack from the Deep Dragon.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:22.000
I shall use my powers
to heal you as much as I can.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.000
No!

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:48.120
I see. So you're the reason
they found out that we're Sorcerers.

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:54.000
Hey, you're not actually
going to try to hit us, are you?

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.910
Oh, come on. Don't be silly.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.750
Of course, I'm going
to hit you by all means possible.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:08.160
Master, it's not a good idea
to waste your energy right now.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.910
Well said, boy!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.830
What're you doing down here?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.290
Oh, it's Bro.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.830
Save us, Bro!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.910
Looks like you're almost healed up, Sorcerer.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:26.870
The name's Salua. What's yours?

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.580
Orphen.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.950
Huh...

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.950
Orphen, huh?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.290
What are you doing?!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.040
Are you just acting like you can't move?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.830
Nope. I really can't.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.410
Ah...

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:22.450
I see. Not bad, Krylancelo.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.080
Hey, are we really going in there?

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:38.160
This area is closest to the
Dragon's sanctuary in Fenrir's Forest.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.830
We've been warned by both

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.620
the royal family and the
Kimluck Church to stay away from here.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.910
My friend and my servant have been captured.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:51.120
We should probably just report it
to the royal family and wait until morning...

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:55.830
How pathetic. And you call yourselves rangers?!

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.500
Then just wait here.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.750
I'll just go by myself!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.950
The Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:13.000
That's what's inscribed in that pendant.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.450
The Successor of the Razor's Edge, Krylancelo.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.000
The man who was seen
to be the eventual successor

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.200
to the most powerful Black Sorcerer, Childman.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.660
Shut up!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:30.700
I'd heard he disappeared from
the Tower of Fangs five years ago,

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:32.080
but apparently, you're the real deal.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:34.200
I told you to shut up!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.750
Well, that's rather unrefined.

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:41.790
Look who's talking! You're the one with a knife!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.000
You seemed like a former ranger,

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.040
but apparently, that's not the case.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.910
A glass sword?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:57.450
I heard there were only
eight in the whole continent.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.750
You must be... the Death Instructor.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:06.200
Salua Solude. I'm honored
that you've heard of me.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:10.620
That's the name given to the
Kimluck Church's personal assassin.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:15.410
I heard that you immediately
dispose of anyone who defies the church.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:18.830
So what the hell are you doing here?

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:25.080
Well what brings Krylancelo of
the Tower of Fangs to the same place?

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.250
Who's going to answer first?

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.580
What the heck are you doing?!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:37.580
Way to go, Miss Claiomh.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:38.950
Where the hell did you come from?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.660
The entrance, duh!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:44.250
You guys were glaring at
each other, so I knocked him out.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.950
Seriously, what are you doing here?

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:51.950
You're the one who told me
to bring the rangers here!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.620
They're waiting on the edge of the village.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:58.790
I'm pretty sure I told you
to wait at the ranger station.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:01.000
Wait, did you?

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.250
Anyway...

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.200
...so what are we gonna do with
these guys that're passed out in this cell?

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:11.950
Oh hey, Majic.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.040
Oh... and the little raccoons are here, too!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.290
Salua!

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.790
And Majic!

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.500
What in the world happened?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.410
Don't worry. If anything, none of them are dead.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:28.500
Who's that?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.500
She's the shrine maiden of this village.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:34.200
Claiomh, you head out first and
clear a way out for us with the rangers.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.250
No!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.620
You're just gonna try to get rid of me again!

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:40.910
Do you hate me or something?

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.290
No, you're just in my way.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.000
Orphen! Wait, wh-what?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.250
Okay... I'll go on ahead.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:57.410
Sorcery?

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:01.290
Yes. It'll be broken by morning.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.620
I have a favor to ask.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:07.290
Please escape from this village immediately
and take Salua and Majic with you.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.660
What about you?

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.580
I will not be joining you.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.250
I will stay here.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.910
I mean, that's fine and all...

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.450
But he's a member of the Kimluck Church...

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.700
I know.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.370
He's the Death Instructor
from the Kimluck Church.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:27.660
I accidentally looked into his heart before.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:33.540
He's the only one in this village
that was friendly with me.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.580
So... I want to save him.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:43.080
Yeah, Majic's out of luck.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:46.750
His goal is to assassinate MacDougal.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:52.040
MacDougal was an instructor at the
Kimluck Church up until a few years ago.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.000
So why did a former instructor
at the Kimluck Church

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.910
turn into the founder of the Dragon Faiths?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.830
I do not know.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:06.410
I was just brought here to deal with
the Deep Dragon who protects this forest.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:10.160
But MacDougal is this village's hero.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:18.910
This is the only weapon
you can use against the Sorcerers.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.000
Since you can't use Sorcery,

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.500
the only way you can defeat the enemies
of the Dragon, known as Sorcerers,

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.950
is for you to make and use these guns,
even though the royal family outlaws them.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:34.200
We shall defeat the Sorcerers.
This shows our loyalty to the Deep Dragon.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:41.700
I will obtain an even stronger weapon.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:46.620
And for that to happen,
I need to find the Dragon's sanctuary...

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:49.790
The heart of this forest.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:53.700
If you go into the heart of
this forest, you're gonna get killed.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.370
I'm aware of that.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.330
The village will probably be destroyed tomorrow.

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:02.450
And that's why I need you
to flee before that happens.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.540
You're going even though
you know you're going to die?

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:15.040
If it is my fate to be destroyed...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.660
I have no regrets...

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:23.450
Because I met friends in the end.
I met Salua and Majic.

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:31.290
Damn it...

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:37.910
Oh, damn it! Why is it always
women that drag me into trouble?!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:43.580
Let me give you some advice.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:48.910
When you ask someone for something,
you need to be persuasive.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.750
I can't accept that request.

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:54.540
B-But...

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:55.830
Ow!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:22:00.330
You're just a child who can't
even break away from my grasp.

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:02.870
I can't just let you die.

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:39.750
I want to protect her.

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:43.620
What the hell? You're gonna
let a girl drag you into trouble, too?

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:46.950
Perhaps students follow
in the footsteps of their masters...

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:46.950
"GATHER IN MY FOREST, WOLVES"
